import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 479 | Jackie Chan Adventures · Energy-Waste Analysis: Talisman Power Used for Personal Adventures","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 479 | Jackie Chan Adventures · Energy-Waste Analysis: Talisman Power Used for Personal Adventures","no":479,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Jackie Chan Adventures","Twelve Talismans","Energy Waste"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","18-Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0479_模块2-成龙历险记-能级浪费解析-符咒力量用于个人冒险.md","filePath":"en/0479_模块2-成龙历险记-能级浪费解析-符咒力量用于个人冒险.md"}'),s={name:"en/0479_模块2-成龙历险记-能级浪费解析-符咒力量用于个人冒险.md"};function o(r,e,l,d,u,h){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-479-jackie-chan-adventures-·-energy-waste-analysis-talisman-power-used-for-personal-adventures" tabindex="-1">Entry 479 | Jackie Chan Adventures · Energy-Waste Analysis: Talisman Power Used for Personal Adventures <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-479-jackie-chan-adventures-·-energy-waste-analysis-talisman-power-used-for-personal-adventures" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 479 | Jackie Chan Adventures · Energy-Waste Analysis: Talisman Power Used for Personal Adventures&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Jackie Chan Adventures Decomposition (Entry 2) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 18, 15</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-twelve-pieces-of-civilizational-grade-power-only-used-for-small-fights" tabindex="-1">Introduction: twelve pieces of civilizational-grade power, only used for small fights <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-twelve-pieces-of-civilizational-grade-power-only-used-for-small-fights" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: twelve pieces of civilizational-grade power, only used for small fights&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — has a very direct judgment on &quot;energy waste&quot;: when a power&#39;s civilizational use far exceeds personal use, its use for personal is waste. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Each of the Twelve Talismans is a specimen of this waste.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per-tally of each talisman&#39;s &quot;civilizational potential&quot; vs. &quot;plot actual use&quot; gap:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Talisman</th><th>Civilizational Potential</th><th>Plot Actual Use</th><th>Waste Ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Rat (animate)</td><td>Reconstruct material production; automation revolution</td><td>Give life to plush toys to make trouble</td><td>Extremely high</td></tr><tr><td>Ox (super strength)</td><td>Engineering, disaster relief, heavy industry</td><td>Jackie punches an enemy away</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Rabbit (super speed)</td><td>Transportation revolution, emergency, logistics</td><td>Jackie escapes</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Rooster (flight)</td><td>Aviation revolution, disaster rescue</td><td>Character floats up</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Snake (invisibility)</td><td>Reconnaissance, public security</td><td>Sneaking around</td><td>Medium-high</td></tr><tr><td>Horse (heal injury)</td><td>Eliminate half of humanity&#39;s diseases</td><td>Occasionally heal a wound</td><td>Extremely high</td></tr><tr><td>Goat (astral projection)</td><td>Consciousness research, medical care</td><td>Soul fighting</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Monkey (shapeshift)</td><td>Materials science, bio-modification</td><td>Turn people into monsters</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Dog (immortality)</td><td>Lifespan revolution, cross-generation knowledge</td><td>Make Uncle younger for a few minutes</td><td>Extremely high</td></tr><tr><td>Pig (electric eye)</td><td>Energy revolution</td><td>Fire lasers</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Dragon (fire)</td><td>Energy, metallurgy</td><td>Breathe fire and fight</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Tiger (yin-yang balance)</td><td>Mind-body medicine, ecological research</td><td>Split Jackie in two</td><td>High</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Conclusion: every one of the Twelve Talismans&#39; civilizational potential compressed into &quot;adventure prop.&quot; This is not individual waste; this is <strong>systemic waste.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When power enough to eliminate disease is locked in a vault, when power enough to extend lifespan is treated as a gimmick to &quot;make an old man younger for a few minutes,&quot; civilization stops in place. Every time the Twelve Talismans appear, Earth should have leaped; but the story loops for hundreds of episodes, Earth is still the Earth that needs Jackie&#39;s fist to solve problems.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Jackie is not an active predator. But his &quot;protect talismans&quot; behavior, structurally equivalent to <strong>privately hoarding civilizational-grade resources in Section 13</strong>. He did not give talismans to the UN, to the scientific community, to any public institution — he locked them where his own people can control. This is &quot;good-guy version hoarding.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Talisman Hoarding</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Talismans locked in vault</td><td>Talisman principles publicized; all humanity studies</td></tr><tr><td>Horse talisman privately hoarded</td><td>Public medical care; healing universal</td></tr><tr><td>Dog talisman privately hoarded</td><td>Lifespan revolution written into public policy</td></tr><tr><td>Jackie&#39;s side monopolizes</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republican co-build</td></tr><tr><td>Occasionally used</td><td>300 Origin systems; energy publicly transformed</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain control: Path A = original animation plot; Path B = talismans publicized. Path B fifty years later, Earth average lifespan from 70 years rises to 200 years, infant mortality drops to zero, global wars disappear (because no zero-sum resource worth fighting for). Path A fifty years later, Earth still grabbing talismans. <strong>The same set of resources, two civilizational fates.</strong></p><p>This control&#39;s deep revelation: talisman power&#39;s waste is not because the power is not big enough, but because the power&#39;s use way is locked by &quot;adventure narrative.&quot; In adventure narrative, talismans must be &quot;props snatched back and forth&quot; — because if it were publicly studied, the story would not be fun. But Heng Yuan Zhou asks: <strong>a fun animation, and a world worth living in, which is more important?</strong> Jackie Chan Adventures chose fun; Heng Yuan Zhou chose worth-living. This is not an aesthetic judgment, it is a value judgment.</p><p>The per-tally waste-ratio table also reveals a commonality: <strong>none of the Twelve Talismans was used for &quot;what it should have been used for.&quot;</strong> Horse talisman should be for medical care, ended up occasionally healing wounds; Dog talisman should be for lifespan research, ended up making Uncle younger; Rat talisman should be for material production, ended up giving life to plush toys. This &quot;wrong-direction use&quot; is not accidental; it is adventure narrative&#39;s inevitable requirement — adventure narrative needs talismans to appear as &quot;props,&quot; not as &quot;infrastructure.&quot; What Heng Yuan Zhou needs to do is turn talismans from props back into infrastructure — let Horse talisman become the foundation of the global medical system, let Dog talisman become the starting point of lifespan research, let Rat talisman become the engine of the automation revolution.</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium</strong>. Talisman ability boundaries weak/strong; yields to plot</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Multi-season settings occasionally contradictory</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium-high</strong>. Talisman contest win/loss tied to Jackie</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: civilizational-grade power compressed into adventure props</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: good-guy version hoarding; locking resources in own vault</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least publicized martial arts; Jackie did not publicize talisman principles</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: talismans only serve Earthlings</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: power principles not publicized</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Twelve Talismans are twelve mountains of gold. What Jackie did is treat every mountain of gold as &quot;something bad guys must not get,&quot; lock it in his own warehouse. He did not do wrong — in a world where bad guys want to use the gold mountain to make cannons, this is the safest choice. But Heng Yuan Zhou asks: <strong>why not smelt the gold mountain into a bridge, let everyone walk across?</strong></p><p>In the final analysis, Jackie Chan Adventures · energy-waste analysis · talisman power used for personal adventures described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./478_模块2-成龙历险记-总论成龙与符咒掠夺体系定性.html">Entry 478 · Overview</a> · <a href="./482_模块2-成龙历险记-十二符咒批判-力量来源的掠夺本质.html">Entry 482 · Twelve Talismans Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/18-修炼资源开放机制.html">18-Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const g=t(s,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
